BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:La Dolce Vita Garden Party
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260627T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260627T173000
UID:3b5ec3abd2906dfd3602bae84507ee9a@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:You're Invited! Garden Party & Silent Auction Join us for an a
 fternoon of beautiful gardens\, great company\, and exciting auction items
  at our Garden Party & Silent Auction. Saturday\, June 27 3:30 PM – 5:30
  PM 100 6th Street\, Petaluma\, CA Hosted by the Petaluma Woman's Club Fou
 ndation\, this special event brings our community together to support loca
 l students and celebrate the spirit of giving. Stroll through the garden\,
  enjoy refreshments\, connect with friends and neighbors\, and bid on an a
 rray of unique items\, experiences\, and gift packages in our silent aucti
 on. Scan the QR code or go to petalumawomansclub.com for tickets All proce
 eds will benefit scholarships for local high school graduates\, helping st
 udents pursue higher education and achieve their future goals. Event Highl
 ights • Garden-inspired refreshments and appetizers • Silent auction f
 eaturing unique items and experiences • Music and fellowship • Support
  scholarships for local students We look forward to celebrating with you
LOCATION:Petaluma\, CA
URL:https://business.petalumachamber.us/events/details/la-dolce-vita-garde
 n-party
X-SOURCE:Petaluma Chamber of Commerce
